    lava (>= 1.10),
    methods,
    lpSolve,
    Rcpp (>= 1.1.2)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.2.3),
    numDeriv,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    generics,
    tibble,
    broom
